---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro"
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro"
import Hero from "../../components/Hero.astro"
import TrustBar from "../../components/TrustBar.astro"
import RealizationCard from "../../components/RealizationCard.astro"
import { SERVICES, BRANDS, ICON_MAP } from "../../lib/services"
export async function getStaticPaths() { return Object.entries(SERVICES).map(([slug, service]) => ({ params: { service: slug }, props: { service } })) }
const { service } = Astro.props
const PHONE = "06 74 98 15 99"
const TEL = "tel:+33674981599"
const IconPath = ICON_MAP[service.icon]
---
<BaseLayout title={`${service.name} à Saint-James (50240) — Anthony PRIME`} description={`${service.name} à Saint-James et alentours : ${service.tagline} Artisan RGE — devis gratuit.`} path={`/services/${service.slug}`}>
  <Fragment slot="header"><Header /></Fragment>
  <Hero title={`${service.name} à Saint-James (50240) et alentours`} tagline={service.tagline} emergency={service.emergency} />
  {service.emergency && <section class="bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground"><div class="container py-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="font-bold text-lg flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg> Une urgence ? Appelez immédiatement.</p><a href={TEL} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-6 py-3 font-extrabold shadow-elegant"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg> {PHONE}</a></div></section>}
  <TrustBar />
  <section class="py-20 bg-background"><div class="container grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
    <div><p class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d={IconPath}/></svg> Notre prestation</p><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-5">{service.name} — savoir-faire local</h2><p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6" set:html={service.description.replace(/\n/g, '<br/>')} /><ul class="space-y-3">{service.bullets.map(b => <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="text-foreground">{b}</span></li>)}</ul></div>
    <aside class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8 shadow-elegant"><p class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4">Artisan certifié</p><h3 class="text-2xl mb-6">Vos garanties</h3><ul class="space-y-4">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-7 w-7 text-primary shrink-0"><path d="M12 22s-8-4.5-8-11.8A8 8 0 0 1 12 2a8 8 0 0 1 8 8.2c0 7.3-8 11.8-8 11.8z"/><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/></svg><div><p class="font-bold">Certifié RGE</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Reconnu Garant de l'Environnement — clé d'accès aux aides.</p></div></li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-7 w-7 text-primary shrink-0"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"/></svg><div><p class="font-bold">Qualibat</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Qualification professionnelle reconnue dans le bâtiment.</p></div></li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-7 w-7 text-primary shrink-0"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a6 6 0 1 1-12 0c0-1.5.5-2.5 1.5-3.5z"/></svg><div><p class="font-bold">Professionnel du Gaz</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Habilité pour l'installation et l'entretien gaz.</p></div></li>
    </ul></aside>
  </div></section>
  <section class="py-20 bg-muted"><div class="container"><div class="max-w-2xl mb-12"><p class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-3">Réalisations</p><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-foreground">Nos derniers chantiers {service.name.toLowerCase()}</h2><p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground text-lg">Un aperçu de nos interventions récentes dans le Sud-Manche et l'Ille-et-Vilaine.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">{service.realizations.map(r => <RealizationCard realization={r} />)}</div></div></section>
  {service.showBrands && <section class="py-16 bg-background"><div class="container"><div class="max-w-2xl mb-8"><p class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-3">Marques partenaires</p><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Des équipements de référence</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4">{BRANDS.map(b => <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-5 py-6 text-center font-bold text-card-foreground hover:shadow-elegant transition">{b}</div>)}</div></div></section>}
  {service.showAids && <section class="py-20 bg-muted"><div class="container"><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg> Aides financières</p><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-5">Profitez de MaPrimeRénov' et des aides à la rénovation</h2><p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8">En tant qu'artisan RGE, Anthony PRIME vous permet de bénéficier des principales aides de l'État pour financer vos travaux d'économie d'énergie.</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">{[{t:"MaPrimeRénov'",d:"Aide de l'État, calculée selon vos revenus et le gain énergétique."},{t:"CEE",d:"Certificats d'Économies d'Énergie : prime versée par les fournisseurs d'énergie."},{t:"TVA 5,5 %",d:"Taux réduit pour les travaux d'amélioration énergétique."}].map(a => <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-elegant"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">{a.t}</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">{a.d}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>}
  <section class="py-20 bg-background"><div class="container text-center max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Un projet de {service.name.toLowerCase()} ?</h2><p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8">Contactez Anthony pour une étude personnalisée et un devis gratuit.</p><a href={TEL} class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-secondary px-8 py-5 text-lg font-extrabold text-secondary-foreground shadow-cta hover:brightness-105 transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg> {PHONE}</a></div></section>
  <Fragment slot="footer"><Footer /></Fragment>
</BaseLayout>
